WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.167
One good idea. Three places to share it.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:07.033
Start with the draft you already have.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:12.567
Shape it for LinkedIn, carousels, or X threads.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:16.367
Edit each draft. Copy the version you need.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:21.433
Set a reminder. Publish it yourself.

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:25.867
VibeShift. Find a new rhythm for your ideas.
